<title>POLAND: BIG issue domestic tranche underwritten.</title>
<headline>BIG issue domestic tranche underwritten.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				    Bank Inicjatyw</p>
<p>						Gospodarczych SA</p>
<p>(BIG)</p>
<p> Total Issue Size (No of Shares):   75,000,000</p>
<p> Domestic tranche size(No shrs):    20,000,000</p>
<p> Issue Type:				new common shares</p>
<p> Price (PLN):			     3.3-5.3</p>
<p>					     MAXIMUM</p>
<p>					     SHARE VALUE   STAND-BY FEE</p>
<p> Underwriter:			    UNDERWRITTEN    (PCT)</p>
<p> Bank Handlowy SA			PLN 5 million     2.3*</p>
<p> Creditantstlt Securities SA	 PLN 5 million     2.3*</p>
<p>* Minimum underwriting fee is 0.2 percent of five million zlotys. Otherwise Handlowy and Creditanstalt will each get 2.3 percent of the value of shares sold at each of their outlets. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
